# ==============================================================================
# 08_circle_maneuver.track
# Continuous Circular Loop Trajectory (Differential Curvature Arc)
# ==============================================================================

SPEED 160

# Engage continuous differential turn to complete a smooth circular trajectory
# Right track drives forward while left track pivots
TURN_LEFT 6.0
WAIT 0.5

# Brief pause
PING
WAIT 0.5

# Reverse direction circle (clockwise arc)
TURN_RIGHT 6.0
WAIT 0.5

STOP
